#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Reversible patcher for Antigravity CLI (agy) and Desktop (Linux x86-64).

Supports three targets in a single zero-dependency Python 3.8+ script:
  - cli:             agy CLI binary (1M-class context window + no auto-compaction)
  - desktop-context: Desktop resources/bin/language_server (983040 context + no auto-compaction)
  - desktop-zh:      Desktop resources/app.asar (Simplified Chinese UI + native menus/dialogs)

Every target uses fail-closed verification (Go pclntab/moduledata symbols or exact
ASAR file anchors), SHA256-verified backups and manifests in $XDG_STATE_HOME/agy-patch,
and atomic file replacement with deterministic rollback.
"""

